              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Motor control board (aftermarket)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$107.98&ndash;$174.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, ICON and MC-series compatible boards, 25 Nov 2026</td></tr>
